title: Bump litep2p to 0.16.0
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Bump litep2p to 0.16.0, which adds the Kademlia client-server mode and fixes
    the panics around local provider records in the Kademlia memory store.
    The litep2p backend handles the new `KademliaEvent::PeersDiscovered` by reporting
    the peers through `Event::PeerRoutingTableUpdate` as before.
crates:
- name: sc-network
  bump: major
- name: sc-network-types
  bump: major
- name: sc-network-bitswap
  bump: patch
